{
  "info": {
    "name": "Zadon API",
    "_postman_id": "8f3f2a1e-2b4c-4d6e-8a9b-1c2d3e4f5a6b",
    "description": "# Zadon API — Postman Collection\n\nTwo APIs:\n- **Customer App API** — public endpoints under `/api` (home, categories, stores, products) + authenticated customer endpoints (auth, profile, addresses, cart, checkout, orders, reviews, wallet, notifications).\n- **Vendor Dashboard API** — all endpoints under `/api/vendor`.\n\n## Setup\n1. Set the `base_url` variable (default `http://127.0.0.1:8000`) to your local server. Run `php artisan serve` to start it.\n2. Log in or register — the **token is captured automatically** into the `app_token` / `vendor_token` collection variables via the response test scripts.\n3. Update the shared **ID variables** (`storeId`, `productId`, `orderId`, etc.) to real IDs returned by your data.\n\n> File upload fields (`avatar`, `image`, `logo`, `cover_image`) are optional. To test them, switch the request body to `form-data` and add the file field.\n\n## Terrains\n- Auth: `Authorization: Bearer {{app_token}}` for the App API, `Bearer {{vendor_token}}` for the Vendor API.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000" },
    { "key": "app_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "vendor_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "storeId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "productId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "categoryId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "orderId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "orderItemId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "cartItemId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "addressId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "notificationId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "reviewId", "value": "1" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Customer App API (/api)",
      "description": "Endpoints used by the customer mobile app.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "register"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Ahmed Ali\",\n  \"phone\": \"0555012345\",\n  \"email\": \"ahmed@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"password123\",\n  \"city\": \"Riyadh\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Create a customer account. Returns a Sanctum `token` (ability `app`) — auto-saved to `app_token`. Optional `avatar` file field (jpg/jpeg/png/webp max 2MB)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('app_token', json.token); pm.test('Token captured', () => pm.expect(json.token).not.undefined); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"0555012345\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Login as a customer. Token auto-saved to `app_token`."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('app_token', json.token); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Home",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/home",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "home"]
            },
            "description": "Public. Returns store categories, featured stores and featured products."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Categories",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/categories?type=store",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "categories"],
              "query": [{ "key": "type", "value": "store", "description": "Optional: `store` or `product`" }]
            },
            "description": "Public. List active categories with children. `type` filter is optional."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List Stores",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/stores?category_id={{categoryId}}&city=Riyadh&search=صيدلية",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "stores"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "category_id", "value": "{{categoryId}}", "description": "Optional filter" },
                { "key": "city", "value": "Riyadh", "description": "Optional filter" },
                { "key": "search", "value": "صيدلية", "description": "Optional name search" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Public. Paginated active stores, ordered by rating."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Show Store",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/stores/{{storeId}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "stores", "{{storeId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Public. Store details. Returns 404 if the store is inactive."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Store Products",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/stores/{{storeId}}/products?category_id={{categoryId}}&search=",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "stores", "{{storeId}}", "products"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "category_id", "value": "{{categoryId}}", "description": "Optional filter" },
                { "key": "search", "value": "", "description": "Optional name search" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Public. Paginated purchasable products for a store."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List Products",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/products?store_id={{storeId}}&category_id={{categoryId}}&search=باراسيتامول",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "products"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "store_id", "value": "{{storeId}}", "description": "Optional filter" },
                { "key": "category_id", "value": "{{categoryId}}", "description": "Optional filter" },
                { "key": "search", "value": "باراسيتامول", "description": "Optional search term" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Public. Paginated purchasable products, ordered by sales."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Show Product",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/products/{{productId}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "products", "{{productId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Public. Product details. Returns 404 if inactive."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{app_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "Revokes the current app token."
          }
        },
